── SYNTAX ERROR ────────────────────────────────── E0100_throws.lt:1:12  [E0100]

Stilt names what a function raises in its row, as `/ raise<E>`:

  1 │ fn risky() throws -> i64 { 1 }
    │            ^^^^^^

The row after `/` lists what the function performs: `io`, and the error type it
raises.

To fix it, delete `throws`:

  1 │ fn risky() throws -> i64 { 1 }
    │            -------
